'''Farnum's Farm''', also commonly called '''Farnum Farmstead''', is an [[Locations|area]] located in the far southern reaches of [[Sacred Grove]]. One of the quickest ways to reach the farm is by heading south from the [[Cobblestone Village]] [[Warpstones|warpstone]].

==Crops for Harvesting==
*Spiralmint
*Stainberry
*Gummyfruit
*Rainleaf
*Stickfruit
*Tumtumnip

